### 🗄️ SQL Multi-Table JOIN Query Output

I successfully attached external databases and executed an advanced multiple `INNER JOIN` query filtering by category on a Mobile Terminal.

**SQL Query:**
```sql
SELECT customers.name, prod.products.name
FROM customers
JOIN orders ON customers.customer_id = orders.customer_id
JOIN prod.products ON orders.product_id = prod.products.id
WHERE prod.products.category = 'Electronics';
```

**Terminal Output:**
```text
Ravi|Laptop
Sita|Phone
Ravi|Headphones
```
